WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Able to live

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:10,100
How much stock do you have of this super coffee?

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,100
3,300 yuan received

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:16,050
Aren’t you dissatisfied?

5
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:17,050
Go move ten boxes of coffee

6
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,050
It will be delivered to the address I gave you later.

7
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:22,050
If nothing unexpected happens, ten boxes a day will be fine from now on.

8
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:30,700
Yes, work

9
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:35,480
Why do you suddenly want to work?

10
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,480
Because I'm waiting for my father to retire

11
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,930
Yu Yu is the big boss of the convenience store.

12
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,930
A big boss can’t be a master of everything
